    "title": "Thomson-McDuffie Recreation Department director has been suspended - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WJBF Staff No media credit provided. ,\n8 hours ago\nTHOMSON, Ga. (WJBF) – The Thomson-McDuffie Recreation Department Director, Trevor Welcher, has been suspended.\nA spokesperson with the county confirmed the news with WJBF NewsChannel 6 on Wednesday.\nA human resources investigation is being conducted, and no additional information is currently being released.\n“Outside of that since it’s personnel matter,” McDuffie County Manager Brandon Burton wrote Wednesday, “I am not able to provide any more details at this time.”\nWelcher has worked with the department for over five years.\nThis is a developing story.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WJBF.\n6",
    "summary": ", THOMSON, Ga. (WJBF) – The Thomson-McDuffie Recreation Department Director, Trevor Welcher, has been suspended. A spokesperson with the county confirmed the news with WJBF NewsChannel 6 on Wednesday. A human resources investigation is being conducted, and no additional information is currently being released. “Outside of that since it’s personnel matter,” McDuffie County Manager Brandon Burton wrote Wednesday, “I am not able to provide any more details at this time.” Welcher has worked with the department for over five years. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WJBF.",
